      "seed": 546018821,
      "version": 49,
      "versionNonce": 2043937189,
      "isDeleted": false,
      "boundElements": null,
      "updated": 1787822703788,
      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "text": "1. Functional Requirements\n\nTemplate Intake: Users select from a predefined service\ncatalog with automated mandatory field validation.\n\nSmart Routing: The workflow engine automatically\ndirects tickets to department queues (HR\n$\\rightarrow$ Finance) with active state tracking.\n\nRole Isolation: RBAC ensures agents only access their\nspecific department queues and tasks.",
      "fontSize": 20,
      "fontFamily": 5,
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "middle",
      "containerId": "FLdolg8Kh4V_0UApgTGB-",
      "originalText": "1. Functional Requirements\n\nTemplate Intake: Users select from a predefined service catalog with automated mandatory field validation.\n\nSmart Routing: The workflow engine automatically directs tickets to department queues (HR $\\rightarrow$ Finance) with active state tracking.\n\nRole Isolation: RBAC ensures agents only access their specific department queues and tasks.",
      "autoResize": true,
      "lineHeight": 1.25
    },
