      "isDeleted": false,
      "boundElements": null,
      "updated": 1787822760477,
      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "text": "2. Non-Functional Requirements\n\nSecurity: Authentication is handled entirely by a trusted\nexternal enterprise SSO provider.\n\nPerformance: Large file attachments and generated PDF\ndocuments are offloaded to cloud blob storage to keep\nthe database lean.\n\nReliability: Status updates are dispatched reliably via an\nexternal transactional email gateway.\n",
      "fontSize": 20,
      "fontFamily": 5,
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "middle",
      "containerId": "pbGZwNVSKNXpqB3wWELNY",
      "originalText": "2. Non-Functional Requirements\n\nSecurity: Authentication is handled entirely by a trusted external enterprise SSO provider.\n\nPerformance: Large file attachments and generated PDF documents are offloaded to cloud blob storage to keep the database lean.\n\nReliability: Status updates are dispatched reliably via an external transactional email gateway.\n",
      "autoResize": true,
      "lineHeight": 1.25
    },
